{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36803","headline":"魏博罗令公附卷有回 · 罗隐","name":"魏博罗令公附卷有回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒门虽得在诸宗，栖北巢南恨不同。\n马上固慙消髀肉，幄中由羡愈头风。\n蹉跎岁月心仍切，迢遰江山梦未通。\n深荷吾宗有知己，好将刀笔爲英雄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36803.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36803","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}